                <pb facs="1098" n="1002" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg1002"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr. Day.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1898-08-23"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">August 23,
                    1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>British Government telegraphed governor of Hongkong on Saturday to accede to
                    Admiral Dewey’s application.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hay.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
